    "detailed_description": "100% Pei video game<br />\r\nStreet Totocher aims to showcase Reunion's culture and rich cultural diversity through a fighting video game. <br />\r\nTotochers include &quot;Kaniar Lakour&quot;, &quot;Ton Matante&quot;, &quot;Sinoi&quot;, &quot;Malbaraise&quot; and &quot;Ton Monmon&quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game also has a humorous dimension, highlighting clich\u00e9s. <br />\r\nThese clich\u00e9s are not negative, &quot;but rather something that belongs to us and is part of our history&quot;.<br />\r\nEveryone will be able to identify with the game, and above all laugh about it with family and friends.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe highlight of the game is the emphasis on the Kr\u00e9ol language.<br />\r\nThe characters will make jokes and provocations in R\u00e9union's characteristic language. Certain characters will have their signature lines, such as Yab's &quot;Ki sa la vole mon can-nard&quot;, or &quot;Koif\u00e9 la&quot; for Kaniar Lakour.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUpdates to the game will be regular and free of charge (new characters, new locations and new game modes).",
    "about_the_game": "100% Pei video game<br />\r\nStreet Totocher aims to showcase Reunion's culture and rich cultural diversity through a fighting video game. <br />\r\nTotochers include &quot;Kaniar Lakour&quot;, &quot;Ton Matante&quot;, &quot;Sinoi&quot;, &quot;Malbaraise&quot; and &quot;Ton Monmon&quot;.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game also has a humorous dimension, highlighting clich\u00e9s. <br />\r\nThese clich\u00e9s are not negative, &quot;but rather something that belongs to us and is part of our history&quot;.<br />\r\nEveryone will be able to identify with the game, and above all laugh about it with family and friends.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe highlight of the game is the emphasis on the Kr\u00e9ol language.<br />\r\nThe characters will make jokes and provocations in R\u00e9union's characteristic language. Certain characters will have their signature lines, such as Yab's &quot;Ki sa la vole mon can-nard&quot;, or &quot;Koif\u00e9 la&quot; for Kaniar Lakour.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUpdates to the game will be regular and free of charge (new characters, new locations and new game modes).",
